## 12.3 Functional prototype behavior

The frontend must do more than look interactive.

Implement working:

- Navigation.
- Language switching.
- RTL/LTR switching.
- Search and filters.
- Profile cards and detail views.
- Multi-step forms.
- Field validation.
- Add/edit/remove sibling entries.
- Dynamic unit conversion.
