- Modals and drawers.
- Notifications.
- Confirmation dialogs.
- Empty states.
- Loading states.
- Demo data updates.
- Save and cancel actions.

Use centralized local mock data and appropriate browser persistence for the prototype where supported.

The user must be able to complete realistic journeys from beginning to end.

Example journey:

Demo role selection → Nadeem dashboard → Create profile → Add family details → Set preferences → Review profile → Save → Search → Review a candidate → Approve a recommendation → Select disclosure fields → Preview a WhatsApp message.

Another journey:

Public landing page → Customer registration → Complete profile → Set preferences → View profile status → Open an authorized sample recommendation → Review privacy settings.

