## 12.6 Performance

Optimize the interface for everyday Android phones and slower networks.

Use:

- Lazy loading where appropriate.
- Efficient component rendering.
- Responsive images.
- Reasonable animation complexity.
- Pagination or virtualization where needed.
- Reusable layout components.
- Minimal unnecessary dependencies.

The intended system must eventually support at least 100,000 active profiles, but the frontend prototype should demonstrate scalable search and pagination patterns rather than loading thousands of records into the browser.

Do not claim production-scale performance has been verified without actual testing.

